 16px;\"\u003eIf you smile through your fear and sorrow\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eSmile and maybe tomorrow\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eYou'll see the sun come shining through\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eFor you.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"verse\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: proxnov-reg, arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eLight up your face with gladness,\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eHide every trace of sadness.\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eAlthough a tear may be ever so near\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"verse\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: proxnov-reg, arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eThat's the time you must keep on trying\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eSmile, what's the use of crying.\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eYou'll find that life is still worthwhile-\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eIf you just smile.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"verse\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: proxnov-reg, arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eThat's the time you must keep on trying\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eSmile, what's the use of crying.\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eYou'll find that life is still worthwhile-\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eIf you just smile.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"verse\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: proxnov-reg, arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eSmile ~ Charlie Chaplin\u003c/i\u003e,\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e1954.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp class=\"verse\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: proxnov-reg, arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eSmile though your heart is aching\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eSmile even though it's breaking.\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eWhen there are clouds in the sky\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eyou'll get by.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"verse\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: proxnov-reg, arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eIf you smile through your fear and sorrow\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eSmile and maybe tomorrow\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eYou'll see the sun come shining through\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eFor you.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"verse\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: proxnov-reg, arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eLight up your face with gladness,\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eHide every trace of sadness.\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eAlthough a tear may be ever so near\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"verse\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: proxnov-reg, arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eThat's the time you must keep on trying\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eSmile, what's the use of crying.\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eYou'll find that life is still worthwhile-\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eIf you just smile.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"verse\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: proxnov-reg, arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 16px;\"\u003eThat's the time you must keep on trying\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eSmile, what's the use of crying.\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eYou'll find that life is still worthwhile-\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"\u003eIf you just smile.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"verse\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: proxnov-reg, arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; line-height: 16px;\"\u003e\u003ci\u003eSmile ~ Charlie Chaplin\u003c/i\u003e,\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003e1954.\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","created_at":1435977329},{"id":204826,"author":"Numberz_","body":"\u003cb\u003e\"Tired of lying in the sunshine staying home to watch the rain\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nYou are young and life is long and there is time to kill today\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nAnd then one day you find ten years have got behind you\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nNo one told you when to run, you missed the starting gun\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nAnd you run and you run to catch up with the sun but it's sinking\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nRacing around to come up behind you again\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nThe sun is the same in a relative way, but you're older\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nShorter of breath and one day closer to death\"\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eTime by Pink Floyd\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cb\u003e\"Tired of lying in the sunshine staying home to watch the rain\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nYou are young and life is long and there is time to kill today\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nAnd then one day you find ten years have got behind you\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nNo one told you when to run, you missed the starting gun\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nAnd you run and you run to catch up with the sun but it's sinking\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nRacing around to come up behind you again\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nThe sun is the same in a relative way, but you're older\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\r\nShorter of breath and one day closer to death\"\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eTime by Pink Floyd\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e","created_at":1435977491},{"id":204837,"author":"smitdalt","body":"\"Its all about that he said she said bullshit\" - Limp Biscuit op","body_tagged":"\"Its all about that he said she said bullshit\" - Limp Biscuit op","created_at":1435980716},{"id":204838,"author":"MidnightBeats","body":"\"I've broken my heart so many times I stopped keeping track.\"\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eHaven't Met You Yet-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003eMichael Bublé","body_tagged":"\"I've broken my heart so many times I stopped keeping track.\"\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eHaven't Met You Yet-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/i\u003eMichael Bublé","created_at":1435982118},{"id":204913,"author":"ViceTechnicolour","body":"\u003cdiv\u003eThere is no pain you are receding\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eA distant ship smoke on the horizon\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eYou are only coming through in waves\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eYour lips move but I can't hear what you're saying\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eWhen I was a child\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eI caught a fleeting glimpse\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eOut of the corner of my eye\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eI turned to look but it was gone\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eI cannot put my finger on it now\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eThe child is grown\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eThe dream is gone\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eI have become comfortably numb.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eComfortably Numb\u003c/b\u003e by \u003cb\u003ePink Floyd\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cdiv\u003eThere is no pain you are receding\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eA distant ship smoke on the horizon\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eYou are only coming through in waves\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eYour lips move but I can't hear what you're saying\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eWhen I was a child\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eI caught a fleeting glimpse\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eOut of the corner of my eye\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eI turned to look but it was gone\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eI cannot put my finger on it now\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eThe child is grown\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eThe dream is gone\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003eI have become comfortably numb.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eComfortably Numb\u003c/b\u003e by \u003cb\u003ePink Floyd\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","created_at":1436008784},{"id":204923,"author":"Legoche","body":"Cos Im Blue\u003cbr\u003edababbabbdaddeee \u003cbr\u003edabdbabdad\u003cbr\u003edababbadeee dabd\u003cbr\u003eadabbdabdbe\u003cbr\u003edabababbababa\u003cbr\u003edeeaddad","body_tagged":"Cos Im Blue\u003cbr\u003edababbabbdaddeee \u003cbr\u003edabdbabdad\u003cbr\u003edababbadeee dabd\u003cbr\u003eadabbdabdbe\u003cbr\u003edabababbababa\u003cbr\u003edeeaddad","created_at":1436013304},{"id":204924,"author":"MangoSmoothie_","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px; line-height: 19px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(204, 204, 221);\"\u003eI used to recognize myself\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px; line-height: 19px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(204, 204, 221);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px; line-height: 19px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(204, 204, 221);\"\u003eIt's funny how reflections change\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, Arial; font-size: 13px; line-height: 19px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(204, 204, 221);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); 